{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Ab]Praise ye the [Eb7]Father [Ab]for His [Db]loving[Ab]kind[Eb]ness,
[Ab]Tenderly [C7]cares He [Fm]for His erring chil[C]dren;
[Ab]Praise Him, ye [Eb7]angels, [Ab]praise Him [Bb]in the [Eb]heavens;
[Ab]Praise [Db]ye Je[Ab]ho [Eb][Ab]vah!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Ab]Praise [Eb7]ye [Ab]the Savior, [Db]great [Ab]is [Eb]the compassion,
[Ab]Graciously [C7]cares He [Fm]for His [C]chosen people;
[Ab]Young [Eb7]men and [Ab]maidens, ye [Bb]old men [Eb]and children,
[Ab][Db]Praise [Ab]ye [Eb]the [Ab]Savior!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Ab]Praise [Eb7]ye [Ab]the [Db]Spirit, [Ab]comforter [Eb]of Israel,
[Ab]Sent of [C7]the Father and [Fm]the Son [C]to bless us;
[Ab]Praise [Eb7]ye the [Ab]Father, [Bb]Son, and [Eb]Holy Spirit,
[Ab][Db]Praise [Ab]the [Eb]Eternal [Ab]Three!
{end_of_verse}
